  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n19(2)/(3)-7(1)/(4) = x + 2(1)/(2),\n\n**Concept:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/a42f9aef507bd10aafdc196d5f4ee8ba11a0ab8ec54fd334313652b0963ff406.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n19(2)/(3)-7(1)/(4) = x + 2(1)/(2),\n\n⇒ 59/3 - 29/4 = x + 5/2\n\n⇒ 236 - 87 = 12x + 30\n\n⇒ x = 119/12\n\n**∴ x = 9(11)/(12)**",
